===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|skyr|lang=non}} from the term ''skjör-ost'' in {{term|w:en:Funen|Fjón|Funen}} in {{term|w:en:Denmark|Denmark}}. The Latin term {{term||[[lac#Latin|lac]] [[concresco#Latin|concretum]]|thick milk}} in [[w:Germania (book)|the book Germania]] by [[w:Tacitus|Tacitus]].

